    "created_at": "2022-05-11T09:55:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-11T09:55:19Z",
    "body": "There seems to be a bigger issue where you can't properly inject `iterm2_prompt_mark` into the end-result PS1, Starship does something to it when inserting the `$character` so it never works as intended. If anyone was able to make it work without glitches, I would be happy to see a solution here 🙂",
